        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.087,
            0.282,
            0.641,
            0.33
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "iterate through numbers in a sequence"
        },
        {
          "type": "code",
          "bbox": [
            0.085,
            0.378,
            0.718,
            0.872
          ],
          "sub_type": "code",
          "content": "```python\n# more complicated with while loop\nn = 0\nwhile n < 5:\n    print(n)\n    n = n+1\n\n# shortcut with for loop\nfor n in range(5):\n    print(n)\n```",
          "captions": [],
          "footnotes": []
        },
        {
          "type": "footer",
          "bbox": [
            0.452,
            0.969,
            0.548,
            0.987
          ],
          "content": "6.0001 LECTURE 2"
        },
        {
          "type": "page_number",
          "bbox": [
            0.892,
            0.969,
            0.911,
            0.989
          ],
          "content": "18"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "page_idx": 18,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.098,
            0.159,
            0.866,
            0.233
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "CONTROL FLOW: for LOOPS"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.086,
            0.276,
            0.752,
            0.407
          ],
          "content": "for &lt;variable&gt; in range(&lt;some_num&gt;): &lt;expression&gt; &lt;expression&gt;"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.086,
            0.63,
            0.963,
            0.681
          ],
          "content": "each time through the loop, &lt;variable&gt; takes a value"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.086,
            0.709,
            0.898,
            0.757
          ],
          "content": "first time, &lt;variable&gt; starts at the smallest value"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.086,
            0.787,
            0.844,
            0.837
          ],
          "content": "next time, &lt;variable&gt; gets the prev value + 1"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.086,
            0.87,
            0.171,
            0.91
          ],
          "content": "etc."
        },
        {
          "type": "footer",
          "bbox": [
            0.452,
            0.968,
            0.548,
            0.988
          ],
          "content": "6.0001 LECTURE 2"
        },
        {
          "type": "page_number",
          "bbox": [
            0.892,
            0.969,
            0.912,
            0.989
          ],
          "content": "19"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "page_idx": 19,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.1,
            0.163,
            0.949,
            0.244
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "range(start,stop,step)"
        },
        {
          "type": "code",
          "bbox": [
            0.084,
            0.265,
            0.946,
            0.886
          ],
          "sub_type": "code",
          "content": "```python\n■ default values are start = 0 and step = 1 and optional\n■ loop until value is stop - 1\n\nmysum = 0\nfor i in range(7, 10):\n    mysum += i\nprint(mysum)\n\nmysum = 0\nfor i in range(5, 11, 2):\n    mysum += i\nprint(mysum)\n```",
          "captions": [],
          "footnotes": []
        },
        {
          "type": "footer",
          "bbox": [
            0.452,
            0.969,
            0.548,
            0.987
          ],
          "content": "6.0001 LECTURE 2"
        },
        {
          "type": "page_number",
          "bbox": [
            0.892,
            0.969,
            0.911,
            0.989
          ],
          "content": "20"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "page_idx": 20,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.096,
            0.161,
            0.625,
            0.233
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "break STATEMENT"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.086,
            0.272,
            0.644,
            0.319
          ],
          "content": "immediately exits whatever loop it is in"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.086,
            0.341,
            0.677,
            0.387
          ],
          "content": "skips remaining expressions in code block"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.087,
            0.41,
            0.469,
            0.457
          ],
          "content": "exits only innermost loop!"
        },
        {
          "type": "code",
          "bbox": [
            0.086,
            0.545,
            0.531,
            0.921
          ],
          "sub_type": "code",
          "content": "```python\nwhile <condition_1>:\n    while <condition_2>:\n        <expression_a>\n        break\n        <expression_b>\n        <expression_c>\n```",
          "captions": [],
          "footnotes": []
        },
        {
          "type": "footer",
          "bbox": [
            0.452,
            0.968,
            0.548,
            0.987
          ],
          "content": "6.0001 LECTURE 2"
        },
        {
          "type": "page_number",
          "bbox": [
            0.892,
            0.969,
            0.911,
            0.989
          ],
          "content": "21"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "page_idx": 21,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.096,
            0.163,
            0.625,
            0.235
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "break STATEMENT"
        },
        {
          "type": "code",
          "bbox": [
            0.085,
            0.291,
            0.665,
            0.709
          ],
          "sub_type": "code",
          "content": "```python\nmysum = 0\nfor i in range(5, 11, 2):\n    mysum += i\n    if mysum == 5:\n        break\n    mysum += 1\nprint(mysum)\n```",
          "captions": [],
          "footnotes": []
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.087,
            0.802,
            0.571,
            0.853
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "what happens in this program?"
        },
        {
          "type": "footer",
          "bbox": [
            0.452,
            0.968,
            0.548,
            0.988
          ],
          "content": "6.0001 LECTURE 2"
        },
        {
          "type": "page_number",
          "bbox": [
            0.892,
            0.969,
            0.911,
            0.989
          ],
          "content": "22"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "page_idx": 22,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.102,
            0.163,
            0.22,
            0.234
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "for"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.087,
            0.275,
            0.247,
            0.328
          ],
          "content": "for loops"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.087,
            0.353,
            0.366,
            0.457
          ],
          "content": "**know** number of iterations"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.086,
            0.483,
            0.368,
            0.585
          ],
          "content": "can **end early** via break"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.087,
            0.619,
            0.334,
            0.664
          ],
          "content": "uses a **counter**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.086,
            0.693,
            0.473,
            0.797
          ],
          "content": "**can rewrite** a for loop using a while loop"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.396,
            0.157,
            0.888,
            0.235
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "VS while LOOPS"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.538,
            0.271,
            0.743,
            0.323
          ],
          "content": "while loops"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.518,
            0.343,
            0.888,
            0.441
          ],
          "content": "**unbounded** number of iterations"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.518,
            0.462,
            0.917,
            0.515
          ],
          "content": "can **end early** via break"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.518,
            0.537,
            0.946,
            0.68
          ],
          "content": "can use a **counter but must initialize** before loop and increment it inside loop"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.518,
            0.701,
            0.948,
            0.843
          ],
          "content": "**may not be able to rewrite** a while loop using a for loop"
        },
        {
          "type": "footer",
          "bbox": [
            0.452,
            0.967,
            0.548,
            0.988
          ],
          "content": "6.0001 LECTURE 2"
